|---|---|---|---|
| SD-1 | **100% accuracy is THE OBJECTIVE. Speed comes after. Do not break the foundation.** | S4-3 | YES |
| SD-2 | **Never assume. Always ask to clarify. Do not guess.** | 1.37 | YES |
