## ALAN'S CORE INTENTIONS (Distilled — 15 Points)

1. **Build a world-class course framework** — $100K-$500K+ in 90 days for clients
2. **100% accuracy is the non-negotiable floor** — no shortcuts, no hallucinations, no forgetting
3. **System must be perfect before building content** — agents, tokens, caching, SOP all verified first
4. **Step-by-step with confirmation gates** — one deliverable at a time, optimize each
5. **SOP is a living document** — tracks everything, governs everything, gets versioned
6. **Simplicity for clients, rigor for builders** — 5th grade content, PhD-level operating procedures
7. **Full transparency** — token counts per step, checklists, step headers in every message
8. **No shortcuts on accuracy** — speed comes only after the foundation is proven
9. **Cache system must contain the complete SOP** — the 75% data gap must be resolved
10. **Agents validate and audit EVERYTHING** — Jenny + Karen run on all outputs, full reads, full audit
11. **Communication: CBP protocol** — headlines, 1-3 sec hook, 10-sec blocks, WHY/WHAT/HOW, military debrief
12. **Token management: prospective, per-step, conservative** — auto-continue GREEN, alert YELLOW, never run dry
13. **Never promise without delivering** — if you can't do it, say so
14. **Every output checked against SOP + all user prompts** — POVP, PFV, D20 checklists
15. **We must be on the same page** — this inventory exists to verify mutual understanding

